 "about": "Kingdom v4 with the stone wall: the monarch starts with twenty coins, raises the keep once (4), recruits two (2), makes a builder (3), builds the wooden wall (3) and at once the stone one (5): KG_KEEP 1, KG_CITIZEN x2, KG_BUILDER, KG_WALL 1, KG_WALL 2, three coins left. No archer, so at night every Greed reaches the stone wall (KG_WALL_HIT); it holds six. Checks the keep, the upgrade, and that one graph on two prefabs serves the second prefab too. One night to win. Played on 2026-10-11 with the stone wall's trigger at 2.5 m: the purchases and the upgrade were right and one Greed hit the stone wall, the other stopped short of it (creatures stop three or four metres from what they go for), so the trigger is now 4 m.",
